  <body>

    <div>

      <p begin="00:01.200" end="00:02.700" ttm:agent="v1">[Intro]</p>

      <p begin="00:02.204" end="00:08.226" ttm:agent="v1">And I don't know if I'll ever make it</p>

      <p begin="00:08.226" end="00:09.726" ttm:agent="v1">And I don't know if I'll ever make it</p>

      <p begin="00:09.059" end="00:12.578" ttm:agent="v1"/>

      <p begin="00:12.578" end="00:14.078" ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p>

      <p begin="00:13.825" end="00:17.083" ttm:agent="v1">My chain a tennis, I put some flawless diamonds in it</p>

      <p begin="00:17.083" end="00:20.094" ttm:agent="v1">I ball like Jordan, my brother ball like Scottie Pippen</p>

      <p begin="00:20.094" end="00:23.394" ttm:agent="v1">I'm stacking millions, start from the floor end at the ceiling</p>

      <p begin="00:23.394" end="00:24.894" ttm:agent="v1">I might be trippin', but I can't tell just what the deal is</p>

      <p begin="00:24.149" end="00:25.652" ttm:agent="v1"/>

      <p begin="00:25.652" end="00:27.152" ttm:agent="v1">[Post-Chorus]</p>

      <p begin="00:26.907" end="00:32.681" ttm:agent="v1">Is it me against the whole world, or am I just paranoid?</p>

      <p begin="00:32.681" end="00:34.181" ttm:agent="v1">Is it me against the whole world, or am I just paranoid?</p>

      <p begin="00:33.879" end="00:38.899" ttm:agent="v1">[Verse]</p>

      <p begin="00:38.899" end="00:42.158" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, I don't want my ex, I don't want no bitch I had</p>

      <p begin="00:42.158" end="00:45.422" ttm:agent="v1">Ghetto boy, I love to flex, just went up a couple racks</p>

      <p begin="00:45.422" end="00:48.242" ttm:agent="v1">Broke up with a text she like, &quot;Damn, what's up with that?&quot;</p>

      <p begin="00:48.242" end="00:51.581" ttm:agent="v1">That shit put me on a jet it's 1 for 6 like running back</p>

      <p begin="00:51.581" end="00:55.100" ttm:agent="v1">Is it me against the whole world? Or I'm just not thinking straight</p>

      <p begin="00:55.100" end="00:58.108" ttm:agent="v1">Hit her ass up face down, don't wanna see her face</p>

      <p begin="00:58.108" end="01:01.362" ttm:agent="v1">Me against the world I don't know what to think (Yeah)</p>

      <p begin="01:01.362" end="01:02.862" ttm:agent="v1">Ima' pour a four of the pink (Pour a four)</p>

      <p begin="01:02.113" end="01:03.613" ttm:agent="v1"/>

      <p begin="01:02.615" end="01:04.135" ttm:agent="v1">[Bridge]</p>

      <p begin="01:04.135" end="01:08.921" ttm:agent="v1">You can try, but you ain't gon' forget about me</p>

      <p begin="01:08.921" end="01:10.928" ttm:agent="v1">(And I don't know If I'll ever make it) Gon' forget about me</p>

      <p begin="01:10.928" end="01:15.080" ttm:agent="v1">You can try, but you ain't gon' forget about me</p>

      <p begin="01:15.080" end="01:16.580" ttm:agent="v1">(And I don't know If I'll ever make it) Gon' forget about me</p>

      <p begin="01:15.832" end="01:17.332" ttm:agent="v1"/>

      <p begin="01:16.333" end="01:17.833" ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p>

      <p begin="01:17.085" end="01:20.097" ttm:agent="v1">My chain a tennis, I put some flawless diamonds in it</p>

      <p begin="01:20.097" end="01:23.379" ttm:agent="v1">I ball like Jordan, my brother ball like Scottie Pippen</p>

      <p begin="01:23.379" end="01:26.390" ttm:agent="v1">I'm stacking millions, start from the floor end at the ceiling</p>

      <p begin="01:26.390" end="01:27.890" ttm:agent="v1">I might be trippin', but I can't tell just what the deal is</p>

      <p begin="01:27.155" end="01:28.741" ttm:agent="v1"/>

      <p begin="01:28.741" end="01:30.241" ttm:agent="v1">[Post-Chorus]</p>

      <p begin="01:29.743" end="01:35.776" ttm:agent="v1">Is It me against the whole world, or am I just paranoid?</p>

      <p begin="01:35.776" end="01:39.776" ttm:agent="v1">Is It me against the whole world, or am I just paranoid?</p>

